{
  "book": "helaman",
  "bookName": "Helaman",
  "chapter": 6,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 677.76,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.158,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when the sixty and second year",
      "verse": "6:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 3.338,
      "end": 7.75,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "of the reign of the judges had ended, all these things had happened",
      "verse": "6:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 7.93,
      "end": 13.038,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Lamanites had become, the more part of them, a righteous people,",
      "verse": "6:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 13.218,
      "end": 21.345,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that their righteousness did exceed that of the Nephites, because of their firmness and their steadiness in the faith.",
      "verse": "6:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 22.025,
      "end": 24.811,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, there were many of the Nephites",
      "verse": "6:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 24.991,
      "end": 32.654,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who had become hardened and impenitent and grossly wicked, insomuch that they did reject the word of God",
      "verse": "6:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 32.834,
      "end": 36.271,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all the preaching and prophesying which did come among them.",
      "verse": "6:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 36.951,
      "end": 43.778,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless, the people of the church did have great joy because of the conversion of the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 43.958,
      "end": 46.234,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, because of the church of God,",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 46.414,
      "end": 48.736,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which had been established among them.",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 48.916,
      "end": 51.424,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they did fellowship one with another,",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 51.604,
      "end": 53.554,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did rejoice one with another,",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 53.734,
      "end": 55.22,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did have great joy.",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 55.9,
      "end": 61.705,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that many of the Lamanites did come down into the land of Zarahemla,",
      "verse": "6:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 61.885,
      "end": 66.436,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did declare unto the people of the Nephites the manner of their conversion,",
      "verse": "6:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 66.616,
      "end": 69.635,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did exhort them to faith and repentance.",
      "verse": "6:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 70.315,
      "end": 79.139,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and many did preach with exceedingly great power and authority, unto the bringing down many of them into the depths of humility,",
      "verse": "6:5",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 79.319,
      "end": 82.059,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to be the humble followers of God and the Lamb.",
      "verse": "6:5",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 82.739,
      "end": 87.755,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that many of the Lamanites did go into the land northward;",
      "verse": "6:6",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 87.935,
      "end": 93.415,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also Nephi and Lehi went into the land northward, to preach unto the people.",
      "verse": "6:6",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 93.595,
      "end": 95.917,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus ended the sixty and third year.",
      "verse": "6:6",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 96.597,
      "end": 99.291,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, there was peace in all the land,",
      "verse": "6:7",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 99.471,
      "end": 101.793,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that the Nephites did go",
      "verse": "6:7",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 101.973,
      "end": 104.806,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "into whatsoever part of the land they would,",
      "verse": "6:7",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 104.986,
      "end": 107.633,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whether among the Nephites or the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "6:7",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 108.313,
      "end": 113.096,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the Lamanites did also go whithersoever they would,",
      "verse": "6:8",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 113.276,
      "end": 117.038,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whether it were among the Lamanites or among the Nephites;",
      "verse": "6:8",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 117.218,
      "end": 120.469,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus they did have free intercourse one with another,",
      "verse": "6:8",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 120.649,
      "end": 121.624,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to buy",
      "verse": "6:8",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 121.804,
      "end": 123.058,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to sell,",
      "verse": "6:8",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 123.238,
      "end": 125.653,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to get gain, according to their desire.",
      "verse": "6:8",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 126.333,
      "end": 129.537,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they became exceedingly rich,",
      "verse": "6:9",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 129.717,
      "end": 132.271,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "both the Lamanites and the Nephites;",
      "verse": "6:9",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 132.451,
      "end": 138.674,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did have a exceeding plenty of gold, and of silver, and of all manner of precious metals,",
      "verse": "6:9",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 138.854,
      "end": 142.105,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "both in the land south and in the land north.",
      "verse": "6:9",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 142.785,
      "end": 145.014,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now the land south was called Lehi,",
      "verse": "6:10",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 145.194,
      "end": 147.702,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the land north was called Mulek,",
      "verse": "6:10",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 147.882,
      "end": 150.018,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was after the son of Zedekiah;",
      "verse": "6:10",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 150.198,
      "end": 153.17,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the Lord did bring Mulek into the land north,",
      "verse": "6:10",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 153.35,
      "end": 155.3,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and Lehi into the land south.",
      "verse": "6:10",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 155.98,
      "end": 162.807,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, there was all manner of gold in both these lands, and of silver, and of precious ore of every kind;",
      "verse": "6:11",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 162.987,
      "end": 165.216,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there were also curious workmen,",
      "verse": "6:11",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 165.396,
      "end": 168.786,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who did work all kinds of ore and did refine it;",
      "verse": "6:11",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 168.966,
      "end": 171.009,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus they did become rich.",
      "verse": "6:11",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 171.689,
      "end": 176.426,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "They did raise grain in abundance, both in the north and in the south;",
      "verse": "6:12",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 176.606,
      "end": 181.018,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did flourish exceedingly, both in the north and in the south.",
      "verse": "6:12",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 181.198,
      "end": 184.867,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they did multiply and wax exceedingly strong in the land.",
      "verse": "6:12",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 185.047,
      "end": 187.508,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they did raise many flocks and herds,",
      "verse": "6:12",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 187.688,
      "end": 189.267,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, many fatlings.",
      "verse": "6:12",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 189.947,
      "end": 192.13,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold their women did toil",
      "verse": "6:13",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 192.31,
      "end": 193.425,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and spin,",
      "verse": "6:13",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 193.605,
      "end": 202.521,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did make all manner of cloth, of fine-twined linen and cloth of every kind, to clothe their nakedness.",
      "verse": "6:13",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 202.701,
      "end": 206.602,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus the sixty and fourth year did pass away in peace.",
      "verse": "6:13",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 207.282,
      "end": 211.229,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And in the sixty and fifth year they did also have great joy and peace,",
      "verse": "6:14",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 211.409,
      "end": 216.425,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, much preaching and many prophecies concerning that which was to come.",
      "verse": "6:14",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 216.605,
      "end": 219.252,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus passed away the sixty and fifth year.",
      "verse": "6:14",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 219.932,
      "end": 225.598,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that in the sixty and sixth year of the reign of the judges,",
      "verse": "6:15",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 225.778,
      "end": 229.679,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, Cezoram was murdered by an unknown hand",
      "verse": "6:15",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 229.859,
      "end": 232.599,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as he sat upon the judgment-seat.",
      "verse": "6:15",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 232.779,
      "end": 235.287,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that in the same year,",
      "verse": "6:15",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 235.467,
      "end": 240.622,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that his son, who had been appointed by the people in his stead, was also murdered.",
      "verse": "6:15",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 240.802,
      "end": 243.356,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus ended the sixty and sixth year.",
      "verse": "6:15",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 244.036,
      "end": 247.473,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And in the commencement of the sixty and seventh year",
      "verse": "6:16",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 247.653,
      "end": 251.043,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the people began to grow exceedingly wicked again.",
      "verse": "6:16",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 251.723,
      "end": 257.017,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, the Lord had blessed them so long with the riches of the world",
      "verse": "6:17",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 257.197,
      "end": 260.262,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they had not been stirred up to anger,",
      "verse": "6:17",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 260.442,
      "end": 262.625,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to wars, nor to bloodshed;",
      "verse": "6:17",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 262.805,
      "end": 266.288,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they began to set their hearts upon their riches;",
      "verse": "6:17",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 266.468,
      "end": 268.79,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, they began to seek to get gain",
      "verse": "6:17",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 268.97,
      "end": 272.081,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might be lifted up one above another;",
      "verse": "6:17",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 272.261,
      "end": 275.187,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they began to commit secret murders,",
      "verse": "6:17",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 275.367,
      "end": 277.317,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to rob and to plunder,",
      "verse": "6:17",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 277.497,
      "end": 279.122,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might get gain.",
      "verse": "6:17",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 279.802,
      "end": 286.536,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold, those murderers and plunderers were a band who had been formed by Kishkumen and Gadianton.",
      "verse": "6:18",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 286.716,
      "end": 288.666,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it had come to pass",
      "verse": "6:18",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 288.846,
      "end": 293.351,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that there were many, even among the Nephites, of Gadianton's band.",
      "verse": "6:18",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 293.531,
      "end": 298.547,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, they were more numerous among the more wicked part of the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "6:18",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 298.727,
      "end": 302.489,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they were called Gadianton's robbers and murderers.",
      "verse": "6:18",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 303.169,
      "end": 309.81,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it was they who did murder the chief judge Cezoram, and his son, while in the judgment-seat;",
      "verse": "6:19",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 309.99,
      "end": 312.498,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold, they were not found.",
      "verse": "6:19",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 313.178,
      "end": 319.029,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that when the Lamanites found that there were robbers among them",
      "verse": "6:20",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 319.209,
      "end": 321.345,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they were exceedingly sorrowful;",
      "verse": "6:20",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 321.525,
      "end": 326.076,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did use every means in their power to destroy them off the face of the earth.",
      "verse": "6:20",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 326.756,
      "end": 335.208,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, Satan did stir up the hearts of the more part of the Nephites, insomuch that they did unite with those bands of robbers,",
      "verse": "6:21",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 335.388,
      "end": 339.01,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did enter into their covenants and their oaths,",
      "verse": "6:21",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 339.19,
      "end": 342.58,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they would protect and preserve one another",
      "verse": "6:21",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 342.76,
      "end": 345.918,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in whatsoever difficult circumstances they should be placed,",
      "verse": "6:21",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 346.098,
      "end": 349.07,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they should not suffer for their murders,",
      "verse": "6:21",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 349.25,
      "end": 351.758,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their plunderings, and their stealings.",
      "verse": "6:21",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 352.438,
      "end": 355.457,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they did have their signs,",
      "verse": "6:22",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 355.637,
      "end": 358.934,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, their secret signs, and their secret words;",
      "verse": "6:22",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 359.114,
      "end": 360.136,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this",
      "verse": "6:22",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 360.316,
      "end": 365.006,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might distinguish a brother who had entered into the covenant,",
      "verse": "6:22",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 365.186,
      "end": 368.205,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that whatsoever wickedness his brother should do",
      "verse": "6:22",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 368.385,
      "end": 370.707,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he should not be injured by his brother,",
      "verse": "6:22",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 370.887,
      "end": 373.441,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nor by those who did belong to his band,",
      "verse": "6:22",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 373.621,
      "end": 375.525,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who had taken this covenant.",
      "verse": "6:22",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 376.205,
      "end": 378.063,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus they might murder,",
      "verse": "6:23",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 378.243,
      "end": 379.358,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and plunder,",
      "verse": "6:23",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 379.538,
      "end": 380.653,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and steal,",
      "verse": "6:23",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 380.833,
      "end": 384.084,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and commit whoredoms and all manner of wickedness,",
      "verse": "6:23",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 384.264,
      "end": 388.815,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "contrary to the laws of their country and also the laws of their God.",
      "verse": "6:23",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 389.495,
      "end": 392.653,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And whosoever of those who belonged to their band",
      "verse": "6:24",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 392.833,
      "end": 397.849,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "should reveal unto the world of their wickedness and their abominations,",
      "verse": "6:24",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 398.029,
      "end": 401.93,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "should be tried, not according to the laws of their country,",
      "verse": "6:24",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 402.11,
      "end": 404.989,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but according to the laws of their wickedness,",
      "verse": "6:24",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 405.169,
      "end": 408.373,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which had been given by Gadianton and Kishkumen.",
      "verse": "6:24",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 409.053,
      "end": 412.629,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now behold, it is these secret oaths and covenants",
      "verse": "6:25",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 412.809,
      "end": 416.756,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which Alma commanded his son should not go forth unto the world,",
      "verse": "6:25",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 416.936,
      "end": 422.044,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "lest they should be a means of bringing down the people unto destruction.",
      "verse": "6:25",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 422.724,
      "end": 427.507,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now behold, those secret oaths and covenants did not come forth unto Gadianton",
      "verse": "6:26",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 427.687,
      "end": 431.216,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "from the records which were delivered unto Helaman;",
      "verse": "6:26",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 431.396,
      "end": 441.148,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but behold, they were put into the heart of Gadianton by that same being who did entice our first parents to partake of the forbidden fruit\u2014",
      "verse": "6:26",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 441.828,
      "end": 444.661,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, that same being who did plot with Cain,",
      "verse": "6:27",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 444.841,
      "end": 447.209,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that if he would murder his brother Abel",
      "verse": "6:27",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 447.389,
      "end": 449.618,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it should not be known unto the world.",
      "verse": "6:27",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 449.798,
      "end": 453.095,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he did plot with Cain and his followers from that time forth.",
      "verse": "6:27",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 453.775,
      "end": 461.02,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And also it is that same being who put it into the hearts of the people to build a tower sufficiently high",
      "verse": "6:28",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 461.2,
      "end": 463.15,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might get to heaven.",
      "verse": "6:28",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 463.33,
      "end": 464.955,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it was that same being",
      "verse": "6:28",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 465.135,
      "end": 468.804,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who led on the people who came from that tower into this land;",
      "verse": "6:28",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 468.984,
      "end": 474.464,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who spread the works of darkness and abominations over all the face of the land,",
      "verse": "6:28",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 474.644,
      "end": 476.78,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "until he dragged the people down",
      "verse": "6:28",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 476.96,
      "end": 480.536,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to an entire destruction, and to an everlasting hell.",
      "verse": "6:28",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 481.216,
      "end": 489.622,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, it is that same being who put it into the heart of Gadianton to still carry on the work of darkness, and of secret murder;",
      "verse": "6:29",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 489.802,
      "end": 494.91,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he has brought it forth from the beginning of man even down to this time.",
      "verse": "6:29",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 495.59,
      "end": 498.701,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, it is he who is the author of all sin.",
      "verse": "6:30",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 498.881,
      "end": 503.479,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, he doth carry on his works of darkness and secret murder,",
      "verse": "6:30",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 503.659,
      "end": 507.931,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and doth hand down their plots, and their oaths, and their covenants,",
      "verse": "6:30",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 508.111,
      "end": 512.43,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their plans of awful wickedness, from generation to generation",
      "verse": "6:30",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 512.61,
      "end": 516.882,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "according as he can get hold upon the hearts of the children of men.",
      "verse": "6:30",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 517.562,
      "end": 524.76,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold, he had got great hold upon the hearts of the Nephites; yea, insomuch that they had become exceedingly wicked;",
      "verse": "6:31",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 524.94,
      "end": 529.584,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, the more part of them had turned out of the way of righteousness,",
      "verse": "6:31",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 529.764,
      "end": 533.293,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did trample under their feet the commandments of God,",
      "verse": "6:31",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 533.473,
      "end": 536.074,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did turn unto their own ways,",
      "verse": "6:31",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 536.254,
      "end": 541.223,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did build up unto themselves idols of their gold and their silver.",
      "verse": "6:31",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 541.903,
      "end": 548.265,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that all these iniquities did come unto them in the space of not many years,",
      "verse": "6:32",
      "lineIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "start": 548.445,
      "end": 552.067,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that a more part of it had come unto them",
      "verse": "6:32",
      "lineIndex": 144
    },
    {
      "start": 552.247,
      "end": 557.216,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in the sixty and seventh year of the reign of the judges over the people of Nephi.",
      "verse": "6:32",
      "lineIndex": 145
    },
    {
      "start": 557.896,
      "end": 562.586,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they did grow in their iniquities in the sixty and eighth year also,",
      "verse": "6:33",
      "lineIndex": 146
    },
    {
      "start": 562.766,
      "end": 565.877,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to the great sorrow and lamentation of the righteous.",
      "verse": "6:33",
      "lineIndex": 147
    },
    {
      "start": 566.557,
      "end": 570.829,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus we see that the Nephites did begin to dwindle in unbelief,",
      "verse": "6:34",
      "lineIndex": 148
    },
    {
      "start": 571.009,
      "end": 573.656,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and grow in wickedness and abominations,",
      "verse": "6:34",
      "lineIndex": 149
    },
    {
      "start": 573.836,
      "end": 578.573,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "while the Lamanites began to grow exceedingly in the knowledge of their God;",
      "verse": "6:34",
      "lineIndex": 150
    },
    {
      "start": 578.753,
      "end": 582.236,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, they did begin to keep his statutes and commandments,",
      "verse": "6:34",
      "lineIndex": 151
    },
    {
      "start": 582.416,
      "end": 585.388,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to walk in truth and uprightness before him.",
      "verse": "6:34",
      "lineIndex": 152
    },
    {
      "start": 586.068,
      "end": 594.427,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus we see that the Spirit of the Lord began to withdraw from the Nephites, because of the wickedness and the hardness of their hearts.",
      "verse": "6:35",
      "lineIndex": 154
    },
    {
      "start": 595.107,
      "end": 604.023,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus we see that the Lord began to pour out his Spirit upon the Lamanites, because of their easiness and willingness to believe in his words.",
      "verse": "6:36",
      "lineIndex": 155
    },
    {
      "start": 604.703,
      "end": 609.626,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the Lamanites did hunt the band of robbers of Gadianton;",
      "verse": "6:37",
      "lineIndex": 156
    },
    {
      "start": 609.806,
      "end": 613.986,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did preach the word of God among the more wicked part of them,",
      "verse": "6:37",
      "lineIndex": 157
    },
    {
      "start": 614.166,
      "end": 619.274,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that this band of robbers was utterly destroyed from among the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "6:37",
      "lineIndex": 158
    },
    {
      "start": 619.954,
      "end": 622.183,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass on the other hand,",
      "verse": "6:38",
      "lineIndex": 159
    },
    {
      "start": 622.363,
      "end": 629.004,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the Nephites did build them up and support them, beginning at the more wicked part of them,",
      "verse": "6:38",
      "lineIndex": 160
    },
    {
      "start": 629.184,
      "end": 632.435,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "until they had overspread all the land of the Nephites,",
      "verse": "6:38",
      "lineIndex": 161
    },
    {
      "start": 632.615,
      "end": 635.726,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and had seduced the more part of the righteous",
      "verse": "6:38",
      "lineIndex": 162
    },
    {
      "start": 635.906,
      "end": 639.11,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "until they had come down to believe in their works",
      "verse": "6:38",
      "lineIndex": 163
    },
    {
      "start": 639.29,
      "end": 641.38,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and partake of their spoils,",
      "verse": "6:38",
      "lineIndex": 164
    },
    {
      "start": 641.56,
      "end": 646.39,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to join with them in their secret murders and combinations.",
      "verse": "6:38",
      "lineIndex": 165
    },
    {
      "start": 647.07,
      "end": 653.479,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus they did obtain the sole management of the government, insomuch that they did trample under their feet",
      "verse": "6:39",
      "lineIndex": 166
    },
    {
      "start": 653.659,
      "end": 654.82,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and smite",
      "verse": "6:39",
      "lineIndex": 167
    },
    {
      "start": 655.0,
      "end": 656.115,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and rend",
      "verse": "6:39",
      "lineIndex": 168
    },
    {
      "start": 656.295,
      "end": 659.267,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and turn their backs upon the poor and the meek,",
      "verse": "6:39",
      "lineIndex": 169
    },
    {
      "start": 659.447,
      "end": 661.908,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the humble followers of God.",
      "verse": "6:39",
      "lineIndex": 170
    },
    {
      "start": 662.588,
      "end": 666.117,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus we see that they were in an awful state,",
      "verse": "6:40",
      "lineIndex": 171
    },
    {
      "start": 666.297,
      "end": 669.083,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ripening for an everlasting destruction.",
      "verse": "6:40",
      "lineIndex": 172
    },
    {
      "start": 669.763,
      "end": 677.101,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that thus ended the sixty and eighth year of the reign of the judges over the people of Nephi.",
      "verse": "6:41",
      "lineIndex": 173
    }
  ]
}